From b9bd39355107c1bde57f58f389fe665db90bf4e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Kershner <dkershner@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 15 May 2025 21:34:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-226950] pmc: add set numeric sensor enable

Add the PLDM command SetNumericSensorEnable. Sensors can be
manually set to ENABLED, DISABLED, or UNAVAILABLE. Sensor
operational state is persisted across soft resets (oobi) as
long as table is not full.

Change-Id: I2a00fdaa7777ab76a59edf574a276aa0d5ed507f
Signed-off-by: David Kershner <dkershner@habana.ai>
---

